{"id":"11bbbd83a4b964cf","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance.md","title":"非可计算 Δ₂ 集合的简单集锥回避","display":"thm-delta2-cone-avoidance — 非可计算 Δ₂ 集合的简单集锥回避","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance","aliases":["20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance"],"display":"thm-delta2-cone-avoidance — 非可计算 Δ₂ 集合的简单集锥回避","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 7.6.1","source_printed_pages":[161],"source_pdf_pages":[195],"depends_on":["[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","[[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]","[[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]","[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-delta2-cone-avoidance — 非可计算 Δ₂ 集合的简单集锥回避"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 7.6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a23aa09d0333bb6\" href=\"?note=9a23aa09d0333bb6\" title=\"20-lem-delta2-preservation\">20-lem-delta2-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5152fdccfe1e0c8e\" href=\"?note=5152fdccfe1e0c8e\" title=\"20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit\">20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 非可计算，且有统一可计算的 0/1 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(x,s)\\to\\chi_C(x)\">\\(c(x,s)\\to\\chi_C(x)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9a23aa09d0333bb6\" href=\"?note=9a23aa09d0333bb6\" title=\"20-lem-delta2-preservation\">20-lem-delta2-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5152fdccfe1e0c8e\" href=\"?note=5152fdccfe1e0c8e\" title=\"20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit\">20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}cone\\text{-}avoidance}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land C\\not\\le_TA].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}cone\\text{-}avoidance}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land C\\not\\le_TA].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=\\varnothing\">\\(A_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 计算各历史限制，选最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\le s\">\\(i\\le s\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{i,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\">\\(W_{i,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\\)</span>，并有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_{i,s}\">\\(x\\in W_{i,s}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;2i\">\\(x&gt;2i\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ge r_*(e,s)\">\\(x\\ge r_*(e,s)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le i\">\\(e\\le i\\)</span>；若存在，枚举最小这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，否则不动。每个正要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i\">\\(P_i\\)</span> 最多行动一次。固定负要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;e\">\\(i&lt;e\\)</span> 的行动能穿过其限制，故损伤有限。两个保持引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C\">\\(\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C\\)</span> 和每个限制的有限极限。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_i\">\\(W_i\\)</span> 无限，取全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le i\">\\(e\\le i\\)</span> 限制稳定且较高正要求不再行动后的阶段；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_i\">\\(W_i\\)</span> 总会出现一个大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2i\">\\(2i\\)</span> 且越过这些有限限制的元素，故与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 相交。余无限性可直接计数：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,2n]\">\\([0,2n]\\)</span> 内，只可能由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 的至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次行动枚举元素，仍留下至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个空位。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 简单，所有负要求共同保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\not\\le_TA\">\\(C\\not\\le_TA\\)</span>。所用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ge r_*\">\\(x\\ge r_*\\)</span> 对应本目录半开 use。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.6.1；印刷页 161；PDF 第 195 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-delta2-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"9a23aa09d0333bb6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit","status":"resolved","id":"5152fdccfe1e0c8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-delta2-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"9a23aa09d0333bb6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]"